    "measurement": "For a finish=True output, compare CPU output-ready timestamp to engine-response dispatch; identify MainLoopSendResponse wait and matching CounterEvent release/model-block end. This measures scheduler host delay, not GPU kernel time.",
    "limitations": [
      "Host timestamps only; no CUDA sync or tensor copies.",
      "Events are buffered; FINISH flush adds I/O after dispatch, so diagnostic HTTP results cannot be primary speed evidence.",
      "Use UniExecutor first so model and scheduler events share a process. MP worker traces require explicit flush or graceful exit."
    ]
